'''RoyalFest''' (女王祭, ''Joōsai'', '''Queen Festival''') is a [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha Event]] that occurs about once every 6 months. It features a random selection of [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]], the exclusive [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Cat]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rares]] from all regular sets. It was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 69.4%
|LegendChance = 0.6%
}}

